      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I guess this is what causes the camera to randomly focus while taking a picture when I use it. It must depend on the angle you pick it up.\nThe issue I see is objects shouldn't be receiving raycast when no ray is visually displayed. when you are within grab distance, the ray visually disappears, so it shouldn't allow input in that case\nThere's a whole separate UX thing here where the camera should actually allow interacting from the screen when you are within grabbing distance, but instead the ray just disappears and you have to grab it unless you do the awkward thing of going to lock the camera just so you can focus it and then unlock it again.\nanyway this whole issue clearly needs work.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
