      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "just getting towards the 1 year anniversary. this is a regular occurrence for me and it's not even tracked internally yet. Just happened to me today build 1275)\n\nwhat happens is I pick up the camera with my right hand, say, and then I push the trigger to take a photo, and it zooms in usually about halfway and ruins the shot.",
